sequenceDiagram
  participant CLI as pele
  participant Layout as pele-go
  participant Raster as resvg (wasm)
  CLI->>Layout: Render(source, options)
  Layout-->>CLI: SVG, width, height
  CLI->>Raster: Rasterize(svg, scale)
  Note over Raster: fonts compiled in,<br/>no cgo or browser
  Raster-->>CLI: image.RGBA
  CLI->>CLI: encode PNG
